  "goodToKnow": "Die Marktwirtschaft is a market economy. Germany's model is die soziale Marktwirtschaft (social market economy), combining free markets with a strong welfare state and worker participation. It's associated with Ludwig Erhard, economics minister from 1949 and father of the Wirtschaftswunder (economic miracle). The GDR had a Planwirtschaft (planned economy). Die Wirtschaft means economy and, colloquially, a pub. Plural: die Marktwirtschaften."
